sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Pipeline as CI Pipeline
  participant Build as Build Step
  participant Guard as Secret Guard
  participant Dev as Developer

  Pipeline->>Build: Build artifacts
  Build->>Guard: Scan bundle for secrets
  alt No secrets
    Guard-->>Pipeline: Pass
  else Secrets found
    Guard-->>Pipeline: Fail
    Pipeline-->>Dev: Fix & whitelist (if needed)
  end
